{"id": 1002821, "slug": "quiet-dan", "name": "QUIET DAN", "name_original": "QUIET DAN", "description": "<p><strong>“Quiet Dan”</strong> is a provocative novel in the format of a visual novel, blurring the boundaries between ordinariness and existential crisis. The protagonist, Dan, a resident of suburban New York City, loses his job as a janitor and sinks into an abyss of loneliness, inner demons, and social injustice. His actions are contradictory and sometimes violent, making the narrative suspenseful and realistic.</p><p><strong>Improvisational style:</strong> the entire text of the novel is fully voiced and dictated on the fly, without subsequent edits, which gives the story liveliness and a sense of “raw” reality. This creates the effect of a theatrical monologue, where Dan's thoughts and dialogues sound as natural as possible</p><p><strong>Genre mix:</strong> includes elements of psychological thriller, social drama and philosophical nonconformism.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-05-07", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-04-20T23:04:19", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/300/300d05d5bcbdcac0addc6a033e492283.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/614/614f4982d299f65688e3acf4ee74c37b.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 5, "title": "exceptional", "count": 2, "percent": 66.67}, {"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 33.33}], "reactions": null, "added": 7, "added_by_status": {"yet": 1, "owned": 3, "beaten": 3}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 6, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 5, "parent_achievements_count": 5, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 3, "suggestions_count": 302, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_coun